ther and spooks john  lennon's wife yoko ono the character of  yo-yo nono adults watching the episode  are able to pick out the real facts from  the satirical retelling of events while  kids stick around for the silly jokes  even brain himself is a reference to  someone that those on the younger side  are unlikely to recognize the pint-sized  genius was designed to look and sound  like orson welles the legendary actor  and director who passed away 10 years  before pinkie and the brain first aired  in nearly every single episode of the  show the brain asked pinkie the exact  same question are you pondering what i'm  pondering of course pinky's response is  always unpredictable and usually gets a  laugh from the audience in fact some of  his quips are even a little off base  with some inappropriate implications  popping up now and then pinky's  ponderings have included a plan to get a  tattoo a suggestion to marry regis  philbin and multiple mentions of  dressing animals in suggestive clothing  pinky are you pondering what i'm  pondering i think so brain but what if  the hippopotamus won't wear the beach  thong  to an innocent mind these jokes might  not seem so cheeky but when it comes to  the mind of an adult it's really easy to  wind up in the gutter even brain seems  to recognize this himself  are you pondering what i'm pondering i  think so blaine but i get all clammy  inside the tent  sigmund freud would have had a field day  with you pinky  at first glance pinky in the brain's  relationship appears to be that of  co-workers who share the common goal of  total world domination when we take a  closer look at their interactions  however it's clear that pinky and the  brain actually care very deeply for one  another the ever faithful pinky is  always ready to go along with brain's  crazy plans no matter how impossible or  embarrassing they might seem the paris  friendship is put to the ultimate test  in a pinky and the brain halloween in  the episode brain is forced to choose  between saving pinky's soul and  achieving his lifelong dream of ruling  the world to the audience's surprise  brain chooses to try and save pinky and  even though he claims that it was only  because his cohort knows the location of  their food pellets it's obvious that  things aren't quite that simple the two  also find themselves filling parental  roles in multiple episodes in two mice  and a baby they take on the task of  raising a superhuman son with pinky as  the mother figure and brain as the  father the same rules reappear in the  episode brinky and this time the couple  is in charge of raising their biological  offspring they pull off these roles with  relative comfort and ease leaving the  audience with a few questions as to the  true nature of their relationship  brain's overly complex plans often  include him and pinky having to play  dress-up in several episodes they end up  disguising themselves as female  characters and they often do so quite  successfully in the episode brain boogie  brain dresses up in a comically  long-legged share outfit in order to  compete in a golfing tournament on more  than one occasion the two disguise  themselves as women even when it doesn't  seem like the easiest option for example  in whatever happened to baby brain brain  takes on the persona of adorable starlet  baby brain a character modeled after  america's little darlene shirley temple  when it comes time for baby brain to  sign a contract after finally making her  big break brain tells the producer that  pinkie is her mother even though  pinkie's gender presentation has nothing  to do with the success of their plan and  a little off the top pinky doesn't skip  a beat when brain orders him to dress up  and seduce samson distracting him so  brain can steal a ring from the biblical  warrior then in my feldman's my friends  pinkie takes on the role of brain's wife  so the pair can infiltrate their  neighbor's house and steal the final  piece they need for their doomsday  device the theme song for pinky and the  brain is one of the catchiest openings  any cartoon has to offer but one line is  particularly memorable one is a genius  the other is insane it seems obvious  that the mouse called brain would be the  smart one after all the intro sequence  shows pinkie's skull nearly empty while  brain's head is full of moving gears  however some fans have a theory that the  truth might not be so simple  in the episode pinkie's turn brain  finally gives pinkie the chance to come  up with his own plan to take over the  world while brain's plans almost always  end in failure and humiliation pinkie's  plan is so successful that he becomes  chairman of the federal reserve and  replaces the us dollar with fruit snacks  in another episode pinkie's plan pinkie  convinces the most powerful world  leaders to hand over the keys to their  nations something the so-called genius  was never able to do finally there's  that famous quote from albert einstein  which could almost certainly apply to  brain  insanity is doing the same thing over  and over again and expecting different  results  we're not here to pass judgment on pinky  but it's pretty obvious that the guy has  a thing for horses after all he was  quick to defend caligula's rather  intimate relationship with his horse in  a meticulous analysis of history  what's wrong with being friendly with a  thorough bread  additionally during a segment from the  animaniacs called jockey for position  pinkie falls in love with a racehorse  named farfight newton evidence in later  episodes of pinkie and the brain and the  animaniacs movie wacko's wish proved  that this horse is in fact pinkie's  girlfriend and in the third mouse pinkie  isn't ashamed to defend his love for the  mayor  people are so intolerant  to kids this relationship may not seem  all that unusual since well the show was  a cartoon but many adults in the  audience have recognized that pinky and  farfig newton's relationship 